title: For Cleo
pid: f7127b71-1331-4db4-8270-0e2bda1064c9
body: |2-
  The save report said "Removed: ... 'r'" and nothing about hides. Had
  it named the hides and unhides the save would infer, or said "hides
  nothing", you would have seen the fault at your first try. That
  needs the server to report its inferred hides in the preview.
